  m_Text: "This is a puzzle system where you can\ngrad, drag and drop objects. \nAlong
    with this, the puzzle uses a \nbehavior to detect if the objects are \ndropped
    in a correct position and \nrotation to complete the puzzle.\nOnce is complete,
    the key in the \ncockpit is able to be picked."
