  m_GameObject: {fileID: 603873427}
  m_Text: "Those turrets are your enemies. You can't grab it, but you can\n hack them.
    You have tto crouch and go to the back side of the turret.\n When you see the
    cartel hack, press T and press WASD in the order\n of the slider, before the time
    ends. \n\nIf you do correctly, the turrets will be your ally. If you do \nincorrectly,
    the turret will detect you."
