  m_GameObject: {fileID: 951580843}
  m_Text: "This is an object above a rail. You have to move \n the box from its position
    to the other side. \n With the powers mode selected, aim to the box, press T \nand
    move the object  back or forward to conect it with this \n rotor. But before plugin
    it, slow down the rotation \nof the other rotor, by shooting the slow power\n
    to the green rotor."
